# Agent session tracker

Distilled knowledge from retired agent sessions, so new sessions in the same area can be
seeded cheaply instead of resuming ever-growing transcripts. The permanent archive is the
PR comment trail — entries here point at it.

**Policy** (see the harness plugin's `rules/operating-model.md` § Agent-session
lifecycle): resume a session freely *within* a PR's review/fix cycles; retire it when
the PR merges and distill what it learned here; seed fresh sessions from these notes for
new PRs in the same area.

Update this file when a PR merges (lead/wave-lead's job). Keep entries short — a few
lines each, not a transcript recap.

